{"kind": "mod", "id": 374, "name": "bluehead's AIO Trader", "slug": "blueheads-aio-trader", "teaser": "Buy everything from one trader. Get all keys with one command.", "owner_name": "bluehead", "downloads": 146663, "favourites": 33, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.bluehead.aiotrader", "thumbnail_local": "thumbs/558.png", "category": "Traders", "category_id": 16, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T07:07:47.000000Z", "created_at": "2022-02-16T05:21:09.000000Z", "published_at": "2022-02-16T05:21:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0.7", "latest_version": "5.2.3", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<h1>Installation</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>copy BlueheadsAIOTrader folder into [SPT_INSTALL_FOLDER]/SPT/user/mods</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>Usage</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>buy everything in game database from AIOTrader</li>\n<li>get AIOKeysCase, AIOAmmoCase, encoded DSP Transmitter by send message to Commando, see how to use Commando[https://wiki.sp-tarkov.com/en/SPT_and_Commando_Bots]</li>\n<li>send <code>aio give key</code> to get a case include all key</li>\n<li>send <code>aio give ammo</code> to get a case include all ammo with 99999 stacked</li>\n<li>send <code>aio give dsp</code> to get a encoded DSP Transmitter</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>Configuration</h1>\n<p>Edit BlueheadsAIOTrader/data/config.json</p>\n<pre><code>   enable_aiotrader: toggle trader\n   realistic_price.enable: toggle the realistic_price\n   custom_price: force aioTrader to sell specific items at the price you specify\n   hide_no_price_item: let aiotrader not sell items without realistic or custom price\n\n   hide_all_ammo_ammopacks: hide ammo &amp; ammopacks from aiotrader to make it load faster\n   hide_all_keys_cards: hide keys &amp; cards from aiotrader to make it load faster\n   hide_all_builtin_inserts: hide armor vest builtin inserts from aiotrader to make it load faster\n</code></pre>\n<h1>Changelog</h1>\n<h2>Version 5.0.0</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>update for spt 4.0.1</li>\n<li>BluheadTrader has been removed. The AIOKeyCase and AIOAmmoCase etc… are now provided via Commando commands for improved mod compatibility.</li>\n<li>get AIOKeysCase, AIOAmmoCase, encoded DSP Transmitter by send message to Commando, see how to use Commando[https://wiki.sp-tarkov.com/en/SPT_and_Commando_Bots]</li>\n<li>send <code>aio give key</code> to get a case include all key</li>\n<li>send <code>aio give ammo</code> to get a case include all ammo with 99999 stacked</li>\n<li>send <code>aio give dsp</code> to get a encoded DSP Transmitter</li>\n</ul>\n", "versions": [{"version": "3.0.2", "spt_version_constraint": "3.7.3", "content_length": null, "downloads": 12803, "published_at": "2023-10-13T04:50:16.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/374/blueheads-aio-trader/3.0.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "3.1.0+beta-3", "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1664, "published_at": "2024-04-02T03:15:38.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/374/blueheads-aio-trader/3.1.0+beta-3", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "3.1.1", "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.1", "content_length": null, "downloads": 12294, "published_at": "2024-04-04T03:00:08.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/374/blueheads-aio-trader/3.1.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "4.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 3919, "published_at": "2024-07-10T02:18:50.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/374/blueheads-aio-trader/4.0.0"